  row:

  Name "Criterion A — Bounded prototype B — Incumbent workflow C — Human-supported pilot D — Targeted further research":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Listed staff-hour assumptions 8 engineering / 4 research / 0 coaching = 12h. Fits role caps 2 engineering / 4 research / 0 coaching = 6h. Fits role caps 0 engineering / 4 research / 4 coaching = 8h. Fits role caps 0 engineering / 6 research / 0 coaching = 6h. Fits role caps":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Potential benefit Inspect one narrow task and test a proposed incremental workflow. Learn whether configuration and guidance can meet the same job. Identify the support and rubric needed to complete the learning task. Resolve one uncertainty that could change a bounded decision.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Bounded scope One invented risk-email task, no launch; assess incremental value before investment. Configure/document one workflow with invented prompts; plan a delayed same-job check. Prepare/rehearse a coached protocol using invented content; participant work is permission-gated. Audit one discriminating question and prepare a comparator protocol, with a time limit.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Risk Building before discovering whether the incumbent already meets the outcome. Apparent success depends on continuous expert setup or hidden effort. Human attention drives the result and cannot be sustained at the proposed cost. Collecting more reports without a stop rule or a decision-relevant question.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Missing evidence A demonstrated residual gap and meaningful incremental outcome. Independent maintenance, access and delayed unaided performance. Which support is necessary, coaching capacity and independent follow-up. Evidence that distinguishes residual need from setup, measurement or selection.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Reversibility Discard the prototype; no production migration. Change instructions or revert to the previous workflow. Stop the rehearsal; do not enroll anyone without approval. Stop when the next observation cannot change the decision.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Success criterion A reviewable task flow and a predefined fair incremental comparison, not a learning-effect claim. A suitable comparator and a test of self-maintained outcome within an agreed effort budget. Specify support, task opportunities and a comparison that separates assistance from unaided performance. A traceable, testable protocol or audit result with a deadline and explicit revision rule.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Poor choice when The incumbent meets this job, no distinct residual task is identified, or engineering capacity cannot fit the plan. Access, data rights or required supervision makes the workflow infeasible. The process needs more coaching than available or proposes unpermitted participant work. The question is already resolved or the proposed research cannot change an action.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

  Name "Reduced-scope alternative Single-screen paper/static prototype and protocol sketch, not a functioning learning product. Rehearse setup instructions with invented prompts and identify one maintenance check. Role-play a single coached task with invented material and log required support. Audit one evidence/metric definition and document a decision-changing observation.":
  [36m<tr />[39m

